# Cuttlefish proof only: do not enroll this virtual device with a remote
# attestation service. AOSP keystore2 and rkpd explicitly support no hostname
# when RKP-only mode is false; ordinary local key generation remains available.
# early-init runs after boot properties are loaded and before core/framework
# consumers. Do not turn off verification or add a privileged proxy service.
on early-init
    setprop remote_provisioning.tee.rkp_only false
    setprop remote_provisioning.hostname ""
